        "fr-extract.jsonl": [
            {
                "entry_id": "74c24475-6438-3877-8d35-d8b826054831",
                "word": "apaisement",
                "pos": "noun",
                "lang_code": "fr",
                "forms": [
                    {
                        "form_id": "e23b2629-3392-43d5-a620-534ec3a4796a",
                        "entry_id": "74c24475-6438-3877-8d35-d8b826054831",
                        "tags": [
                            "plural"
                        ],
                        "form": "apaisements"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "5bbda7e5-5f22-32c6-ae74-94f67af6359b",
                        "entry_id": "74c24475-6438-3877-8d35-d8b826054831",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Action d’apaiser ou résultat de cette action."
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "acd29bd0-8d2e-463a-8c5f-75012ffa10e7",
                                "sense_id": "5bbda7e5-5f22-32c6-ae74-94f67af6359b",
                                "text": "Mais il a aussi la propriété de diminuer le mouvement des vagues à la surface, ce qui explique l’apaisement des flots dans cette zone qui est une aire de repos pour les bateaux en difficulté."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3ea4d643-ccc0-48b0-b235-e6fe4066c157",
                                "sense_id": "5bbda7e5-5f22-32c6-ae74-94f67af6359b",
                                "text": "Apaisement ! apaisement ! Hélas ! nous écoutera-t-on ?"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bca3b3fd-7a78-4be3-9a93-f9a60643a84f",
                                "sense_id": "5bbda7e5-5f22-32c6-ae74-94f67af6359b",
                                "text": "Une loi peut être de combat ou dʼapaisement."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "04e93494-fba2-4646-9065-42aae9db48fe",
                                "sense_id": "5bbda7e5-5f22-32c6-ae74-94f67af6359b",
                                "text": "Les cycles infinis du désir cherchant la satisfaction pour goûter à l’apaisement, puis renaissant avec un autre désir, un autre cycle, sont l'essence même de la vie."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "11424ce8-fc86-4e52-a523-d7e26430ee4f",
                        "source_entry_id": "74c24475-6438-3877-8d35-d8b826054831",
                        "source_sense_id": "5bbda7e5-5f22-32c6-ae74-94f67af6359b",
                        "source_sense_description": "Action d’apaiser ou résultat de cette action",
                        "target_lang_word": "Beruhigung",
                        "target_lang_code": "de",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "Beruhigung",
                                "target_lang_code": "de",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ec641781-c191-373f-9779-dd9f1a1dcab3",
                                        "entry_id": "acf651ef-283a-38b8-b8d5-e57ffd14cdd2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "das Entspannen einer Situation"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "daf1f656-03b1-407a-980c-5d197a5c5005",
                                                "sense_id": "ec641781-c191-373f-9779-dd9f1a1dcab3",
                                                "text": "„Als die Stadtguardia 1741 aufgehoben und die Bewachung durch reguläres Militär vorgenommen wurde, kam es zu einer Beruhigung der Situation.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"1\""
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "1db0da73-4b43-322f-bdcc-192b0b686ca3",
                                        "entry_id": "acf651ef-283a-38b8-b8d5-e57ffd14cdd2",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "ein entspannter Gemütszustand"
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "76fbae01-eb2e-432c-a09c-2cda83b0600c",
                                                "sense_id": "1db0da73-4b43-322f-bdcc-192b0b686ca3",
                                                "text": "„Blutdrucksenker zur Wehenhemmung, Krebsmittel gegen die Makuladegeneration im Auge, ein Schlafmittel für Erwachsene zur Beruhigung von Kindern.“"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "ff0e6a7d-2f3e-4c03-b3d4-114b35d88b51",
                                                "sense_id": "1db0da73-4b43-322f-bdcc-192b0b686ca3",
                                                "text": "„‚Natürlich wird alles wieder gut! Ganz sicher!‘, antwortete auch Marie und ich fühlte eine tiefe Beruhigung.“"
                                            }
                                        ],
                                        "sense_index_json": "\"2\""
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "ef0dfdc0-7cc3-4f4b-ae22-7e480f2156c9",
                        "source_entry_id": "74c24475-6438-3877-8d35-d8b826054831",
                        "source_sense_id": "5bbda7e5-5f22-32c6-ae74-94f67af6359b",
                        "source_sense_description": "Action d’apaiser ou résultat de cette action",
                        "target_lang_word": "appeasement",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "appeasement",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "9523af96-e8dc-372d-9467-e6fecb000d93",
                                        "entry_id": "5709de90-e65f-3fa0-914b-1354a89bf4a3",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The state of being appeased; the policy of giving in to demands in order to preserve the peace."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fe08409d-c116-476c-b63f-2d3757bfd9d1",
                                                "sense_id": "9523af96-e8dc-372d-9467-e6fecb000d93",
                                                "text": "This decision is the end of any attempts at appeasement in our land; the end of urging us to get along with the dictators, the end of compromise with tyranny and the forces of oppression."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "679374a2-b8c9-49d2-a636-954ea1f9d311",
                                                "sense_id": "9523af96-e8dc-372d-9467-e6fecb000d93",
                                                "text": "Senator, Saturday on television, you said that you had always thought that Quemoy and Matsu were unwise places to draw our defense line in the Far East. Would you comment further on that, and also address to this question: couldn't a pull-back from those islands be interpreted as appeasement?"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "315fc74e-6d6a-4fd3-8cbd-dea46a9e232b",
                                                "sense_id": "9523af96-e8dc-372d-9467-e6fecb000d93",
                                                "text": "What’s crucial is that the Taiwanese people preserve their individual freedom and the planet does not endure a third world war. The best way for the United States to pursue those goals is by maintaining America’s military support for Taiwan while also maintaining the “one China” framework that for more than four decades has helped keep the peace in one of the most dangerous places on earth.\nHawks will call this appeasement. So be it. Ask them how many American lives they’re willing to risk so the United States can have official diplomatic relations with Taiwan."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
